    </exercise>
    <exercise number="5" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>Does the graph of a general logarithmic function have a horizontal asymptote? Explain.</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>No. A horizontal asymptote would suggest a limit on the range, and the range of any logarithmic function in general form is all real numbers.</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
